# NOTE: this file is INERT on GitHub Pages, which is where the site is hosted
# today — GitHub Pages does not read _headers and sends no security headers at
# all. It is kept here so the rules apply immediately if the site is ever put
# behind Cloudflare Pages or Netlify, both of which do honour this format.
# Until then, the only header-level protection in effect is HTTPS itself
# (Enforce HTTPS is on). See claude/site-review-beyond-seo for the options.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
